# The castle under construction (docs/rules/construction.md, "The castle under construction"): from the click that places it the castle
# grows from the bottom up over its whole shadow by its progress word, with no ground, base, or scaffold under it, and once it stands it
# is drawn whole. The shots at the ticks 30, 31, and 32 show it grow a little each pass. The castle's click places it at 24,3. The shots crop around the castle's node.
# Run it on the game view of the basic content set with seed 1234567812345634 and size 1, with no install and no SIEDLER_DIR
# (play/castle-growing.play runs the same on the History Edition):
#   sh tools/play-run.sh castle-growing-basic --game-view --content-set basic --seed 1234567812345634 --size 1 --fps 10
expect seed = 1234567812345634
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 24 3
wait 0.1
list placed
expect-count building = 1
dump placed
shot placed 24 3 1 3
fast-forward until ticks >= 20 max 60000
wait 0.1
list early
dump early
shot early 24 3 1 3
fast-forward until ticks >= 30 max 60000
wait 0.1
list tick30
shot tick30 24 3 1 3
fast-forward until ticks >= 31 max 60000
wait 0.1
list tick31
shot tick31 24 3 1 3
fast-forward until ticks >= 32 max 60000
wait 0.1
list tick32
shot tick32 24 3 1 3
fast-forward until ticks >= 45 max 60000
wait 0.1
list mid
dump mid
shot mid 24 3 1 3
fast-forward until ticks >= 200 max 60000
wait 0.3
list stands
dump stands
shot stands 24 3 1 3
